eject is called.\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"undefined"},{"type":"text","value":" cannot be queued (it is the internal \"no item\" sentinel) and is always rejected.\nItems can be inserted based on priority or at the front/back depending on configuration."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns true if the item was added, false if the queue is full."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example usage:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"queuer.addItem('task');\nqueuer.addItem('task2', 'front');","lang":"ts"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"item","children":[{"type":"text","value":"item"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TValue"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"position","children":[{"type":"text","value":"position?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueuePosition"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":5,"id":"runonitemschange","children":[{"type":"text","value":"runOnItemsChange?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"returns-2","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"queuer","children":[{"type":"text","value":"queuer"}]},{"type":"code","value":"queuer: AngularQueuer<TValue, TSelected>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/queuer/injectQueuedSignal.ts#L10","children":[{"type":"text","value":"queuer/injectQueuedSignal.ts:10"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tvalue","text":"TValue","level":3},{"id":"tselected","text":"TSelected","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2},{"id":"additem","text":"addItem","level":3},{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":4},{"id":"item","text":"item","level":5},{"id":"position","text":"position?","level":5},{"id":"runonitemschange","text":"runOnItemsChange?","level":5},{"id":"returns-2","text":"Returns","level":4},{"id":"queuer","text":"queuer","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [queuer/injectQueuedSignal.ts:7](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/queuer/injectQueuedSignal.ts#L7)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\n### TSelected\n\n`TSelected` = \\{\n\\}\n\n```ts\nQueuedSignal(): TValue[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [queuer/injectQueuedSignal.ts:8](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/queuer/injectQueuedSignal.ts#L8)\n\n## Returns\n\n`TValue`[]\n\n## Properties\n\n### addItem\n\n```ts\naddItem: (item, position?, runOnItemsChange?) => boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [queuer/injectQueuedSignal.ts:9](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/queuer/injectQueuedSignal.ts#L9)\n\nAdds an item to the queue. If the queue is full, the item is rejected and onReject is called.\n`undefined` cannot be queued (it is the internal \"no item\" sentinel) and is always rejected.\nItems can be inserted based on priority or at the front/back depending on configuration.\n\nReturns true if the item was added, false if the queue is full.\n\nExample usage:\n```ts\nqueuer.addItem('task');\nqueuer.addItem('task2', 'front');\n```\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### item\n\n`TValue`\n\n##### position?\n\n`QueuePosition`\n\n##### runOnItemsChange?\n\n`boolean`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\n***\n\n### queuer\n\n```ts\nqueuer: AngularQueuer<TValue, TSelected>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [queuer/injectQueuedSignal.ts:10](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/queuer/injectQueuedSignal.ts#L10)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: QueuedSignal\ntitle: QueuedSignal\n---\n\nDefined in: [queuer/injectQueuedSignal.ts:7](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/queuer/injectQueuedSignal.ts#L7)\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TValue\n\n`TValue`\n\n### TSelected\n\n`TSelected` = \\{\n\\}\n\n```ts\nQueuedSignal(): TValue[];\n```\n\nDefined in: [queuer/injectQueuedSignal.ts:8](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/queuer/injectQueuedSignal.ts#L8)\n\n## Returns\n\n`TValue`[]\n\n## Properties\n\n### addItem\n\n```ts\naddItem: (item, position?, runOnItemsChange?) => boolean;\n```\n\nDefined in: [queuer/injectQueuedSignal.ts:9](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/queuer/injectQueuedSignal.ts#L9)\n\nAdds an item to the queue. If the queue is full, the item is rejected and onReject is called.\n`undefined` cannot be queued (it is the internal \"no item\" sentinel) and is always rejected.\nItems can be inserted based on priority or at the front/back depending on configuration.\n\nReturns true if the item was added, false if the queue is full.\n\nExample usage:\n```ts\nqueuer.addItem('task');\nqueuer.addItem('task2', 'front');\n```\n\n#### Parameters\n\n##### item\n\n`TValue`\n\n##### position?\n\n`QueuePosition`\n\n##### runOnItemsChange?\n\n`boolean`\n\n#### Returns\n\n`boolean`\n\n***\n\n### queuer\n\n```ts\nqueuer: AngularQueuer<TValue, TSelected>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [queuer/injectQueuedSignal.ts:10](https://github.com/TanStack/pacer/blob/main/packages/angular-pacer/src/queuer/injectQueuedSignal.ts#L10)\n"}
